{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10115120","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10115120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011513001:":{"text":"엘로나예요.","source_cn":"是艾洛娜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F555E66B2E28DB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011513002:":{"text":"브라이언이 보낸 나뭇잎 편지군요...","source_cn":"布莱恩捎来一封叶信……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911DA8A62232B1B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011513003:":{"text":"앞에 있는 부두에서 만나자고 하네요!","source_cn":"让我们去前面的码头找他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11C18A2BD5B8F6FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011512001:1":{"text":"젠장... 젠장! 왜 이미르는 황혼의 나무를 부패시키려는 거지?!","source_cn":"可恶……可恶！为什么想腐化流荧树的人是伊米尔？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC118DC91D9888044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1011512002:0":{"text":"숲을 아프게 하다니. 이미르는 현자라 불릴 자격이 없어!","source_cn":"做出伤害丛林的事，他已经不配被称为贤者了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB40047641E9D90D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_tit