!","source_cn":"那老头，难道看不惯三派共治，想把薄暮丛林的一切都掌握在自己手里吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7975FDA2C392A8E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1011512012:0":{"text":"젠장! 조금 더 일찍 이 일을 알았더라면!!","source_cn":"混蛋！要是我们早一点发现他在干什么就好了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C2A797F519A079","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1011512013:1":{"text":"로잔, 지금은 자책할 때가 아니야. 이미르가 이런 짓을 저지를 줄은 그 누구도 알 수 없었어.","source_cn":"洛桑，现在不是自艾自怜的时候，伊米尔会做出这种事情，任...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507047CB94EE95A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1011512014:1":{"text":"지금 우리가 해야 할 일은 기운을 내는 거야.","source_cn":"我们现在能做的，是要打起精神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5333132BEE11ED24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1011512015:1":{"text":"음모를 알고, 이미르를 막을 수 있는 건 우리 밖에 없어!","source_cn":"知晓阴谋，而且能够阻止伊米尔的，只有我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x702A1E9AC3A5A215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1011512016:0":{"text":"누나...","source_cn":"姐姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x273FF2E6DDBAC42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1011512016":{"text":"누나...","source_cn":"姐姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x273FF2E6DDBAC42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1011512017:1":{"text":"네, 하지만 이미르가 숲을 부패시키려는 동기를 도통 모르겠네요...","source_cn":"嗯，但不知道伊米尔腐化丛林的动机究竟为何……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5F9CA6D500011D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1011512018:1":{"text":"이 부패 지점은 이미 기록했어요. 이제 어떻게 할까요? 황혼의 나무로 계속 나아갈까요?","source_cn":"这处腐化地点已记录下来。后续我们要如何行动？要继续前往...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6CA7CFDF452E0EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1011512019:0":{"text":"잠깐, 저쪽에 무언가 날아오고 있어요!","source_cn":"等一下，你们看——有东西飞过来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AAC7C28BAB39E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:36:1011513001:":{"text":"엘로나예요.","source_cn":"是艾洛娜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F555E66B2E28DB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"